ally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "countable", "target_term": "可数"}, {"source_term": "disjoint unions", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "complete", "target_term": "完备化"}, {"source_term": "localize", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "disjoint unions", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "refines", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "cohomology groups", "target_term": "上同调群"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n景（site）<MATH_0001>的底层范畴（underlying category）具有合理的“封闭”性质，即给定其中的概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>，<MATH_0003>的任意局部（locally）闭子概形（closed subscheme）都同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0004>的某个对象（object）。其他这样的封闭性质包括：在概形（schemes）的纤维积（fibre products）下封闭，可以取可数（countable）不交并（disjoint unions），可以取给定概形（scheme）上的有限型（finite type）概形（schemes）；给定仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0005>，可以对<MATH_0006>完备化（complete）、局部化（localize），或取其模某个理想（ideal）的商（quotient），同时仍留在该范畴（category）内，等等。另一方面，例如，对<MATH_0007>中的概形（schemes）取任意不交并（disjoint unions）就会离开它。还要注意，给定<MATH_0008>作为<MATH_0009>的对象（object），会存在<MATH_0010>-覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0011>（如定义<REF_0001>中所述），它们不是<MATH_0012>中的覆盖（coverings），例如因为概形（schemes）<MATH_0013>不是范畴（category）<MATH_0014>的对象（objects）。但是，我们对景（sites）<MATH_0015>的选择使得总存在<MATH_0016>作为<MATH_0017>的覆盖（covering），加细（refines）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0018>，见《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>和<REF_0006>。本章中我们大多会忽略这些问题。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n若<MATH_0019>是<MATH_0020>或<MATH_0021>上的层（sheaf），则我们用<MATHSEG_0001>特别地<MATHSEG_0002>表示<MATH_0022>在景（site）的对象（object）<MATH_0023>上的上同调群（cohomology groups），见第<REF_0007>节。因此我们有<MATH_0024>、<MATH_0025>、<MATH_0026>、<MATH_0027>和<MATH_0028>。最后两个记号可能有歧义，因为它们可以指大（big）或小（small）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或Zariski景（site）。由下面的引理，这一歧义并无妨碍。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:b0ce7c93928239d5d8718e8d6f358dd06761f1352c576af50d6dc54fb93d3267", "unit_id": "tag:03X7:prose-0003", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "概形的景。", "source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "景的底层范畴。", "source_term": "underlying category", "target_term": "底层范畴"}, {"context": "景的对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "局部闭的性质。", "source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"context": "局部闭子概形。", "source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"context": "与景的对象同构。", "source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "景或范畴的对象。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "概形的各种运算。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "概形的纤维积。", "source_term": "fibre pro